# Analyzer summary caches generated by tom_analyzer_shared. These `.sum`
# bundles are regenerable, machine/analyzer-version-specific build artifacts.
# Tracking them poisons the cache on every analyzer upgrade (an analyzer-8
# bundle is undecodable by analyzer 10's bundle_reader -> RangeError), and
# bloats the published archive. They regenerate on demand.
**/.tom/analyzer-cache/
